        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Actually, I'd say six months. Actually, no, closer to about three months.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:33",
      "end_timestamp": "00:39",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:40",
      "end_timestamp": "00:49",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "It's moderate, honestly. It's on and off. It's worse with looking up and turning in bed. I took the morning off to come in today. I've had being unsteady for a few minutes too, for about three months. As for being unsteady for a few minutes, I'd say moderate. I've also been feeling sick, for about three months.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:53",
      "end_timestamp": "01:21",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "symptoms[1]",
        "symptoms[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Have you noticed double vision or weakness?",
